<h3>2026-10-22 — Forager body background and hero buttons</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> The forager theme body background is the leaf green <code>#e8f3e0</code>, not the default blue. The home hero no longer repeats the navigation pills.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> The page background still read as the application blue. The application menu now owns those buttons.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>root/static/css/themes/forager.css</code>, <code>root/Forager/index.tt</code>.</p>
